<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Winkin Support & Help Center</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #2E8B57;
      --primary-dark: #1E5C3A;
      --primary-light: #E8F5E9;
      --text-main: #0F172A;
      --text-muted: #64748B;
      --bg-page: #F8FAFC;
      --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
      --border-color: #E2E8F0;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-page);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1E5C3A 0%, #2E8B57 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 48px 24px 64px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 16px;
      opacity: 0.9;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: -32px auto 48px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }

    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .contact-item {
      background: var(--bg-page);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact-icon {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .contact-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .contact-val {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin-top: 4px;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    .contact-val a {
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .contact-val a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .faq-item {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 16px 0;
    }

    .faq-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .faq-question {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .faq-answer {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #475569;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .badge-alert {
      background: #FFF1F2;
      border: 1px solid #FECDD3;
      color: #9F1239;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .btn-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: var(--primary-light);
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px 20px 48px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="brand-logo">
      <span>🌾</span> Winkin
    </div>
    <h1>Customer Support & Help Center</h1>
    <p>We are here to assist you with orders, deliveries, and account management.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container">

    <!-- Contact Channels -->
    <div class="card">
      <h2>📬 Contact Us</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px;">Our support team is active 7 days a week to ensure fast assistance.</p>
      
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-item">
          <div class="contact-icon">📧</div>
          <div class="contact-label">Email Support</div>
          <div class="contact-val">
            <a href="mailto:support@winkin.store">support@winkin.store</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-item">
          <div class="contact-icon">⏰</div>
          <div class="contact-label">Operating Hours</div>
          <div class="contact-val">7:00 AM - 11:00 PM (GMT)</div>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-item">
          <div class="contact-icon">⚡</div>
          <div class="contact-label">Response Time</div>
          <div class="contact-val">Under 15 Minutes</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Account Deletion (Apple Guideline 5.1.1 Compliance) -->
    <div class="card">
      <h2>🗑️ Account Deletion & Data Privacy</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #475569;">
        You can permanently delete your Winkin account and associated data directly within the app at any time.
      </p>

      <div class="badge-alert">
        <strong>Steps to delete your account:</strong><br>
        1. Open the <strong>Winkin app</strong> on your iPhone or iPad.<br>
        2. Tap on the <strong>Profile (Barn)</strong> tab in the bottom menu.<br>
        3. Scroll down and tap <strong>"Delete Account"</strong>.<br>
        4. Select your reason, check the confirmation box, and confirm deletion.<br>
        <em>All your personal data, order history, active referrals, and saved addresses will be immediately purged.</em>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 12px;">
        To request manual deletion via email, send a message to <a href="mailto:privacy@winkin.store" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600;">privacy@winkin.store</a> with your registered phone number.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <div class="card">
      <h2>❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">1. How do I track my order?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          You will receive real-time push notifications once your order is confirmed, and you can view live delivery progress in the <strong>Order History</strong> section of the app.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">2. What is your refund policy?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          If any item in your order is missing, damaged, or incorrect, please email <a href="mailto:support@winkin.store">support@winkin.store</a> within 24 hours of delivery for a replacement or full refund.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">3. How do I update my profile or delivery address?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          You can update your name and phone number in the <strong>Profile</strong> screen, and manage delivery addresses during checkout.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Legal & Terms of Use -->
    <div class="card">
      <h2>📄 Terms of Use & Policies</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted);">
        Review our standard terms and Apple license agreement:
      </p>
      <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-pill">
        📄 Apple Standard EULA (Terms of Use) ↗
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Winkin. Developed by Arishna IoT Solutions. All rights reserved.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 4px;">Support: <a href="mailto:support@winkin.store">support@winkin.store</a></p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
